{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clockwork Palace </strong>is a cozy Mughal Fantasy puzzle adventure where time has stopped and only you can set it right. Explore hand-painted halls, mirror chambers, and celestial observatories as you uncover the secrets of a palace frozen mid-motion. Solve more than 40 handcrafted time-based puzzles, turning gears, rotating clock hands, and mastering clever logic challenges. Team up with a playful jinn companion who guides you with gentle hints as you gather and manipulate Time Gems. Restore the palace\u2019s lost magic piece by piece and unravel the mystery behind its timeless stillness!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mughal-inspired fantasy world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463220/extras/eaa73bdde7527443d87096035e8b78f9.poster.avif?t=1764939061\" width=1170 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463220/extras/eaa73bdde7527443d87096035e8b78f9.webm?t=1764939061\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463220/extras/eaa73bdde7527443d87096035e8b78f9.mp4?t=1764939061\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and manipulate Time Gems and practice time quantity puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463220/extras/fc964649cf2708db244ed053870c0695.poster.avif?t=1764939061\" width=1170 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463220/extras/fc964649cf2708db244ed053870c0695.webm?t=1764939061\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\